        "Sumper (2002) & Lenoci-Camp (2008) hierarchical Cahn-Hilliard diatom biosilica phase separation faithfully reproduces Coscinodiscus wailesii (Centric marine diatom frustule valve pores: foramen, cribrum, cribrella) morphology" ;
