<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sumper-diatom-frustule-phase-sep-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sumper (2002) & Lenoci-Camp (2008) hierarchical Cahn-Hilliard diatom biosilica phase separation — Model fidelity to source: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the fourth-order Cahn-Hilliard PDE with exact Fourier zero-mode mass conservation (drift < 1e-15), Lenoci & Camp's (2008) Section 3.3 two-stage quenched hierarchical solidification (`simulate_two_stage_hierarchical_diatom`, L164-242), the analytical spinodal dispersion relation sigma(k) = M*k^2*(1 - 3*phi0^2 - eps^2*k^2) (`compute_spinodal_dispersion`, L76-123), and an outside-spinodal negative control (phi0=-0.65, alpha=-0.2675 < 0) verified to decay to 0 pores. Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_071_diatom_frustule_phase_sep.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sumper-diatom-frustule-phase-sep-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sumper-diatom-frustule-phase-sep-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sumper-diatom-frustule-phase-sep-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sumper-diatom-frustule-phase-sep-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sumper (2002) & Lenoci-Camp (2008) hierarchical Cahn-Hilliard diatom biosilica phase separation — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Uses 3-point parabolic sub-bin radial PSD interpolation (`_parabolic_subbin_peak`, L290-302), validates linear wavelength scaling across epsilon (`r = 0.9865`, `RMSE = 0.95 px`), quantifies 6-fold hexatic bond-orientational order `|psi_6|` on both simulated droplets and 139 SEM foramina (`0.764` vs reference `0.75`), measures nested cribrum sub-pore multiplicity per foramen, and verifies 3-tier self-similar scaling (`|r| = 0.9999`, `rho = 0.1833` vs reference `0.1800`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
